Lane complete. Working tree clean, two commits on `dispatcher/web045-calc-lead`, no push.

**Root cause (this repo):** `capacity-planner` and `seasonal-capacity` calculators mount `ToolLeadCapture`, but the API route's `VALID_TOOLS` rejected them with 400 before any hub call ΓÇö those leads could never reach the CRM. Hub errors were also swallowed (status-only log, body discarded), hiding 401 key mismatches and hub 400s behind a generic 502.

**Fixed in `app/api/tools/capture/route.ts`:** both slugs added to `VALID_TOOLS`; hub response body + missing-env var names now logged; trailing slash trimmed from `HUB_API_URL`. `npx tsc --noEmit` clean; capture-route tests 9/9 pass.

**Hub-side (not edited, in notes):** hub `VALID_TOOLS` still lacks `capacity-planner`, `seasonal-capacity`, and the three resource slugs ΓÇö those flows stay blocked until the hub repo is updated.
